w concept of shooting puzzle game.\nIt is a shooting puzzle game that makes a way for AI characters wandering in a maze to move easily and safely.\n\n100 stages with various solutions.\nVarious maze shapes, slippers, objects, and daemons are combined, so each stage can be played differently each time.", "short_description": "Save the slippers that are hanging in the maze of nightmares!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)3000_900.png", "id": "429007318575366", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003276_429007321908699_4258283118475983943_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3ydKlqKvW4cQ7kNvwHKbOaB&_nc_oc=Adnr90WOYNipULpipjlksNLJ6pnB83u4j5AaUX5zdsqj8lAJfvCo6m8JG0ZT7rFjdXM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afzb62Paj3QqhFf5_8EPPm3Fz641tUb1lPXiVLFuJ6Md-Q&oe=69BFD92A"}, {"file_name": "\ub354\ud074\ub77c\uc774\uc5b8\ud2b8\ub85c\uace0(\ud55c\uae00).png", "id": "3213236945564295", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974517_3213236948897628_4786406447797518072_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ySjDfM4hnnsQ7kNvwECPBgT&_nc_oc=AdkegzFS3TqIzOLG-ZjhYBBK2Th9P-fe2yc8anZacGCGyYgSSlWttXnB-hX3ZBfPT50&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyKNF1hlS4XrwDEk_VzzUGLlMTwNnvpysV9i-HYFBbyXw&oe=69BFEBDE"}, {"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)2560_1440.png", "id": "1042171706627527", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75429288_1042171713294193_695814847444454466_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=94O_pcVe6kMQ7kNvwFlDrVT&_nc_oc=AdkOVcBs6FmjsIVg8H5XIPtU8rQ3h1LzHYMq5XvmCZVeM5Tm8owxRAqPamQXDuEcTM8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxVRnvt6lNQh1lstCUTgf2adToeow5xN34cMtaIKy6YMw&oe=69BFDAB1"}, {"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)1080_360.png", "id": "9